      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Deeper Investigation\n\n- [**Prometheus** (direct UI)](http://prometheus.localhost) — PromQL queries\n- [**Grafana Explore → Prometheus**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22prometheus%22%7D)\n- [**Grafana Explore → Loki**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22loki%22%7D) — search `service=\"payment-service\"`\n- [**Grafana Explore → Tempo**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22%7D) — search traces by service name\n\n### gRPC Tooling\n\nFrom inside the Docker network:\n\n```bash\ndocker compose exec payment-service \\\n  grpcurl -plaintext localhost:9093 list\ndocker compose exec payment-service \\\n  grpcurl -plaintext localhost:9093 describe omp.payment.PaymentService\n```\n\n### Service Notes\n\n- **No REST API.** This service is gRPC-only (port 9093). The management HTTP port (9094) serves only actuator endpoints.\n- **No external access.** Not routed through Traefik. Internal-only.\n- **Called by order-service** for payment intent operations.\n- **Phase 5** will add webhook-driven payment confirmation from an external provider."
      }
